constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{5}
bills[i] contains only {5, 10, 20}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def lemonadeChange(self, N, bills):
		d = {5: 0, 10: 0, 20: 0}
		for i in bills:
			if i == 5:
				d[i] += 1
			if i == 10:
				if d[5] > 0:
					d[i] += 1
					d[5] -= 1
				else:
					return False
			if i == 20:
				if d[10] and d[5]:
					d[i] += 1
					d[10] -= 1
					d[5] -= 1
				elif d[10]:
					return False
				elif d[5] >= 3:
					d[i] += 20
					d[5] -= 3
				else:
					return False
		return True
